---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service - Team Riley" description="Terms and conditions for using Team Riley's services">
  <Navigation />

  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 md:pb-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50 to-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8">Last Updated: March 10, 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              By accessing or using Team Riley's services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Services Description</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Team Riley provides web design, development, and maintenance services for health and wellness businesses. Our services include:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Custom website design and development</li>
              <li>Website hosting and maintenance</li>
              <li>Unlimited updates and modifications</li>
              <li>SEO optimization and performance improvements</li>
              <li>Technical support and consulting</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Subscription Plans</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Our services are offered on a subscription basis with three tiers:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Silver Plan:</strong> $199/month + $500 setup fee (1-5 pages)</li>
              <li><strong>Gold Plan:</strong> $399/month + $500 setup fee (5-15 pages)</li>
              <li><strong>Platinum Plan:</strong> $599/month + $500 setup fee (15+ pages)</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mt-4">
              All plans include unlimited updates. Subscriptions are billed monthly and can be cancelled at any time.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Payment Terms</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Setup fee and first month's subscription are due at project initiation</li>
              <li>Monthly subscriptions are billed on the 1st of each month</li>
              <li>Payments are non-refundable</li>
              <li>Late payments may result in service suspension</li>
              <li>You are responsible for all applicable taxes</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Cancellation Policy</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              You may cancel your subscription at any time with no penalties. Upon cancellation, your website will remain live until the end of your current billing period. You will receive all website files and retain full ownership of your content.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
              <strong>Your Content:</strong> You retain all rights to content you provide (text, images, logos, etc.). By using our services, you grant us a license to use your content to create and maintain your website.
            </p>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              <strong>Our Work:</strong> Upon full payment, you own the final website design and code. We retain the right to use the work in our portfolio unless otherwise agreed in writing.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. Client Responsibilities</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">You agree to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Provide necessary content, materials, and feedback in a timely manner</li>
              <li>Ensure all content provided is legally owned or licensed</li>
              <li>Maintain your domain registration</li>
              <li>Use the website in compliance with applicable laws</li>
              <li>Not use the service for illegal or harmful purposes</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">8. Service Availability</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We strive for 99.9% uptime but cannot guarantee uninterrupted service. We are not liable for downtime caused by hosting providers, internet outages, or other factors beyond our control. Scheduled maintenance will be communicated in advance when possible.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Team Riley's liability is limited to the amount paid for services in the 12 months preceding any claim. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages, including loss of profits, data, or business opportunities.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">10. Warranty Disclaimer</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Services are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee specific results, search engine rankings, or traffic levels.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">11. Indemnification</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              You agree to indemnify and hold Team Riley harmless from any claims arising from your use of our services, your content, or your violation of these terms.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">12. Modifications to Terms</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Significant changes will be communicated via email. Continued use of our services after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">13. Governing Law</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              These terms are governed by the laws of Louisiana, United States. Any disputes will be resolved in the courts of Louisiana.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">14. Contact Information</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              For questions about these terms, please contact us:
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Team Riley</p>
              <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@teamriley.com" class="text-primary-700 hover:text-primary-800">hello@teamriley.com</a></p>
              <p>Phone: <a href="tel:2256144765" class="text-primary-700 hover:text-primary-800">(225) 614-4765</a></p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
